# Base rates of reasoning_gym logic and games tasks on both models, one GPU per
# (model, category): which tasks have headroom, at what difficulty, and how long their
# solutions run at an 8192-token budget. Specs exclude tasks whose verifier accepts a
# trivial answer (propositional_logic: the premises' conjunction; puzzle24: any
# expression equal to 24) and the binary-answer ones (circuit_logic, syllogism).
